[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Solaar reaches Logitech receivers through libusb, so users who are to
configure their devices need access to the USB device nodes.  A devd(8)
rule in %%PREFIX%%/etc/devd/solaar.conf grants that to the "operator"
group, for Logitech hardware only.  Add yourself to that group and log in
again:

	pw groupmod operator -m yourusername
	service devd restart

Rules that simulate input (KeyPress, MouseClick and MouseScroll actions)
additionally need the uinput(4) module:

	kldload uinput
	sysrc kld_list+="uinput"
EOM
}
]
